<is-land on:visible><div id="comp-732c1354-f5e2-4ef3-87d8-0576f34d8a88" class="AccordionGroup" data-component-type="AccordionGroup"><div class="de-accordion-group bg-white theme-light"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Frequently asked questions</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div id="yPH8xOPLz9TaanWkLmD7X" class="de-accordion scroll-anchor"><h3 class="de-accordion__header"><button type="button" class="de-accordion__toggle" data-ste-element="accordion-header-what-are-the-main-differences-between-simatic-s7-1200-g2-and-the-previous-generation-of-simatic-s7-1200-controllers?" id="accordion-toggle-yPH8xOPLz9TaanWkLmD7X" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-yPH8xOPLz9TaanWkLmD7X" tabindex="0"><span class="de-accordion__focus-target"><span class="de-accordion__title">What are the main differences between SIMATIC S7-1200 G2 and the previous generation of SIMATIC S7-1200 controllers?  </span><span class="de-accordion__icon"><svg class="icon icon-normal" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg></span></span></button></h3><div class="de-accordion__body" data-ste-element="accordion-body-what-are-the-main-differences-between-simatic-s7-1200-g2-and-the-previous-generation-of-simatic-s7-1200-controllers?" hidden="" id="accordion-content-yPH8xOPLz9TaanWkLmD7X" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-toggle-yPH8xOPLz9TaanWkLmD7X" aria-hidden="true"><div class="de-accordion-group__content de-accordion-group__content-article"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>SIMATIC S7-1200 G2 introduces a wide range of improvements compared to the previous SIMATIC S7-1200 generation:</p><p><b>Enhanced Performance &amp; Scalability: <br/></b>SIMATIC S7-1200 G2 provides significantly higher processing power, increased memory, and improved communication performance, enabling faster data processing and more efficient multitasking. </p><p><b>Efficient Motion Control: <br/></b>The new generation supports enhanced motion control functionalities, including precise control of single axes, coordinated axes, and simple kinematics – improving productivity and simplifying machine operations. </p><p><b>Flexible Machine Safety: <br/></b>A cost optimized fail-safe hardware portfolio enables flexible and reliable integration of safety functions within machines and systems. </p><p><b>Increased Data Transparency: <br/></b>SIMATIC S7-1200 G2 enables wireless access to diagnostic and device information through Near Field Communication (NFC). It also features an integrated web server and Web API to support modern connectivity and seamless system integration. <br/><br/>For more details and additional benefits of the new controller generation, please refer to our <a href="https://contentpath.siemens.com/en-s71200g2-migration/migration-s7-1200-g2">migration overview</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="6uG04K0zYaQVFygZLUCbYL" class="de-accordion scroll-anchor"><h3 class="de-accordion__header"><button type="button" class="de-accordion__toggle" data-ste-element="accordion-header-is-the-new-simatic-s7‑1200-g2-controller-generation-compatible-with-previous-simatic-s7‑1200-modules?" id="accordion-toggle-6uG04K0zYaQVFygZLUCbYL" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-6uG04K0zYaQVFygZLUCbYL" tabindex="0"><span class="de-accordion__focus-target"><span class="de-accordion__title">Is the new SIMATIC S7‑1200 G2 controller generation compatible with previous SIMATIC S7‑1200 modules?</span><span class="de-accordion__icon"><svg class="icon icon-normal" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg></span></span></button></h3><div class="de-accordion__body" data-ste-element="accordion-body-is-the-new-simatic-s7‑1200-g2-controller-generation-compatible-with-previous-simatic-s7‑1200-modules?" hidden="" id="accordion-content-6uG04K0zYaQVFygZLUCbYL" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-toggle-6uG04K0zYaQVFygZLUCbYL" aria-hidden="true"><div class="de-accordion-group__content de-accordion-group__content-article"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>The new SIMATIC S7‑1200 G2 controller generation is not hardware‑compatible with the previous SIMATIC S7‑1200 family. While existing SIMATIC S7‑1200 PLC programs can typically be converted for SIMATIC S7‑1200 G2 with only minor adjustments, hardware compatibility must be checked in advance. </p><p>More information and a step by step guide can be found in our comprehensive <a href="https://contentpath.siemens.com/en-s71200g2-migration/migration-s7-1200-g2">migration overview</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="1Cpf4TmpuCjGE6gdEAz6CO" class="de-accordion scroll-anchor"><h3 class="de-accordion__header"><button type="button" class="de-accordion__toggle" data-ste-element="accordion-header-are-there-any-training-courses-available-for-simatic-s7-1200-g2?" id="accordion-toggle-1Cpf4TmpuCjGE6gdEAz6CO" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-1Cpf4TmpuCjGE6gdEAz6CO" tabindex="0"><span class="de-accordion__focus-target"><span class="de-accordion__title">Are there any training courses available for SIMATIC S7-1200 G2?</span><span class="de-accordion__icon"><svg class="icon icon-normal" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg></span></span></button></h3><div class="de-accordion__body" data-ste-element="accordion-body-are-there-any-training-courses-available-for-simatic-s7-1200-g2?" hidden="" id="accordion-content-1Cpf4TmpuCjGE6gdEAz6CO" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-toggle-1Cpf4TmpuCjGE6gdEAz6CO" aria-hidden="true"><div class="de-accordion-group__content de-accordion-group__content-article"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>Yes, with our digital learning platform SITRAIN access, you can explore a wide range of complimentary SIMATIC S7-1200 G2 training courses – no Learning Membership required. Simply log in, enter the Freemium section, and discover engaging, high-quality learning modules designed to help you get the most out of the new SIMATIC S7-1200 G2 portfolio. <br/><br/>Whether you&#x27;re new to the technology or looking to deepen your expertise, SITRAIN access provides flexible, on-demand learning that empowers you to level up your automation skills anytime, anywhere. </p><p>Click here for the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://siemens-learning-sitrainaccess.sabacloud.com/Saba/Web/EU2PRD0112?signin=true">SITRAIN access Login</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="Knv0aej8b9DIrCfKWvNPR" class="de-accordion scroll-anchor"><h3 class="de-accordion__header"><button type="button" class="de-accordion__toggle" data-ste-element="accordion-header-what-sustainability-benefits-does-simatic-s7-1200-g2-offer?" id="accordion-toggle-Knv0aej8b9DIrCfKWvNPR" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-Knv0aej8b9DIrCfKWvNPR" tabindex="0"><span class="de-accordion__focus-target"><span class="de-accordion__title">What sustainability benefits does SIMATIC S7-1200 G2 offer?</span><span class="de-accordion__icon"><svg class="icon icon-normal" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg></span></span></button></h3><div class="de-accordion__body" data-ste-element="accordion-body-what-sustainability-benefits-does-simatic-s7-1200-g2-offer?" hidden="" id="accordion-content-Knv0aej8b9DIrCfKWvNPR" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-toggle-Knv0aej8b9DIrCfKWv